Internal IPs are not looked up in a dry run: <internal-ip:INSTANCE> stands for the address
--yes reads with tn_internal_ip before the first change.
DRY RUN (no --yes): nothing below runs; no host is touched and no gcloud call is made.

>>> [validator-4-devnet] firewall-setup.sh --gateway-from <internal-ip:gateway-4-devnet> (for gateway-4-devnet)
    sudo bash /opt/telcoin-node-scripts/firewall-setup.sh --json --enable --gateway-from <internal-ip:gateway-4-devnet>

>>> [validator-4-devnet] edit-config.sh gateway_upstream=<internal-ip:gateway-4-devnet> (a stopped node stays stopped)
    sudo bash /opt/telcoin-node-scripts/edit-config.sh --json --set gateway_upstream=<internal-ip:gateway-4-devnet>

>>> [gateway-4-devnet] setup-gateway.sh --enable (standalone, node4.devnet.telcoin.network, upstream validator-4-devnet)
    sudo bash /opt/telcoin-node-scripts/setup-gateway.sh --enable --yes --json --mode standalone --network devnet --image 'us-docker.pkg.dev/telcoin-network/tn-public/worker-gateway@sha256:8b887098f5cc5cb5ebc591bc82b1347513b23ae3ecca4f22787b2e4204f8c231' --domain node4.devnet.telcoin.network --front caddy --upstream <internal-ip:validator-4-devnet> --rpc-port 8545 --health-port 43174 --redirect-queries 'https://rpc.devnet.telcoin.network'

